Now, I would like to use the whole dataset also with missing values. I add the parameter missing=”fiml” inside the sem function. The warning occurs that “DWLS” estimator could not be used with incomplete data.

Do you have any suggestions how to analyse my model with incomplete data?

Thanks in advance, Anja

