> dataMI <- amelia(data,m=5,ords=c(1:26))    ### ords indicates that I would like to have all variables to be ordered (1-5, and the last five variables should be dichotomous)

Are all your variables ordered?  In your model below, you are treating them as continuous, and only treating bi1-bi5 as ordered/binary.  Your imputation and analysis models should be consistent.

> dataMI <- amelia(data,m=5,ords=c("bi1", "bi2", "bi3", "bi4","bi5"))

Also, make sure to also use the "idvars" argument to specify any variables that should be ignored in the imputation process.

